message: "If you use Syntonmancy or its technical disclosure, please cite this record."
title: "字势静兼 / Syntonmancy 2.1.6 — 得字解句式跨维聊天平台（技术披露与可复现材料）"
abstract: >-
  A local-first character-drawing chat platform. Each turn draws 1–30 characters
  from a 3,000-character bank; the model must use every drawn character in a
  word_layer, write an interpretation that is at least 70% grounded in that
  word layer and at most 30% free association, and derive the user-facing reply
  from the interpretation. Only the last 8 messages / 1,200 characters are
  supplied as weak context.
